## What safety parts we’re adding

| Feature | Safety part we’ll implement |
|---------|------------------------------|
| Logins with email only | Supabase Auth magic link, correct redirect URI |
| Private messages | `messages` table Row‑Level‑Security (RLS) – only sender/recipient can read or write |
| Keys | All Supabase keys live in Bolt Secrets, NOT in a `.env` file that gets committed |
| Data lock | Supabase RLS rules ensure each user sees only their own rows |
| Save points | Every step will be a `git commit` (or Bolt snapshot) before we touch code |

